@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Check In tickets for event " + ViewBag.EventName;
}
@* This page will display a list of tickets that have been purchased for the event. It will allow the authenticated user to check in or out tickets using a button next to the name of the person on the ticket. It should also show simple stats like the number of tickets checkedin and the number of total tickets sold. It should not display any price information or refund options unless the user has access to view/edit price details about the event. *@